1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:10,600
Nowadays more and more college students have come to realize social practice and academic learning are equally important.
如今，越来越多的大学生开始认识到，社会实践和学术学习同样重要。

2
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:18,990
Knowledge from textbooks lays the foundation for our abilities, while hands-on experience turns that knowledge into real skills.
书本知识为我们的能力奠定基础，而亲身实践则把这些知识转化为真正的技能。

3
00:00:19,790 --> 00:00:23,410
On the one hand, academic learning is indispensable.
一方面，学术学习是不可或缺的。

4
00:00:24,210 --> 00:00:30,070
Without a solid grasp of theories and methods, social practice would lack direction and achieve little.
如果没有扎实地掌握理论和方法，社会实践就会缺乏方向，收效甚微。

5
00:00:30,870 --> 00:00:35,260
On the other hand, social practice deepens and tests what we have learned.
另一方面，社会实践能深化和检验我们所学的知识。

6
00:00:36,060 --> 00:00:50,610
When students take part in internships, field research or volunteer programs, they not only apply their knowledge to real problems but also develop communication, teamwork and problem-solving skills that classrooms alone can hardly provide.
当学生参加实习、实地调研或志愿项目时，他们不仅能把知识运用于实际问题，还能培养沟通、团队协作和解决问题的能力，而这些能力是单靠课堂很难提供的。

7
00:00:51,410 --> 00:01:03,610
Last summer, several agriculture majors in my department spent a month helping farmers in a village improve their crops, and they came back with a much deeper understanding of what they had learned in class.
去年夏天，我们系几名农学专业的学生花了一个月时间帮助一个村子的农民改良庄稼，回来时，他们对课堂上学到的知识有了深刻得多的理解。

8
00:01:04,410 --> 00:01:07,800
Therefore, college students should strike a balance between the two.
因此，大学生应该在两者之间保持平衡。

9
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:10,690
Neither should be sacrificed for the other.
二者都不应为了另一方而被牺牲。

10
00:01:11,490 --> 00:01:19,970
They should study hard in class while seizing every opportunity to gain practical experience, so that theory and practice can reinforce each other.
他们应该在课堂上努力学习，同时抓住一切机会获取实践经验，从而使理论和实践相互促进。

11
00:01:20,770 --> 00:01:25,580
Students who do so will grow into well-rounded graduates ready to serve society.
这样做的学生将成长为全面发展、随时准备服务社会的毕业生。
